    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">55 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Machine-coding case</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Observer + Strategy + Facade</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Concurrency</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Pub-Sub / Message Queue (Kafka-lite)</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Build an in-memory message broker in 90 minutes: topics split into partitions, producers that never wait for consumers, consumer groups with their own offsets, per-key ordering, retries with backoff, a dead-letter topic and replay. Running code in Java, Python and C++14, plus the concurrency story the interviewer will push on.</p>\n"
